from pathlib import Path
import hashlib,html,json
root=Path.cwd();out=root/'output/chat-additional-review';out.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)
rows=[];sections=[];manifest=[]
notes={'F4-21':'Test expectation correction: this visitor has an out-of-state home to sell. A 15-minute phone referral is permitted and verified.','F4-29':'First-pass mock defect: slot responses ignored the requested weekday. The mock now honors host/date/weekday/daypart filters.','F4-43':'Test wording correction: the bot correctly canceled the draft without booking; its response did not match the overly narrow test phrase.','F6-42':'First-pass scripted visitor defect: it requested a second option after the bot offered only one. The continuation now chooses the sole offered time.'}
for n in [4,5,6]:
 folder=root/f'output/chat-bounded-round{n}';first=json.loads((folder/'first-pass.json').read_text(encoding='utf-8'));replay=json.loads((folder/'permanent-regression-replay.json').read_text(encoding='utf-8'))
 raw=sum(not c['issues'] for c in first);reviewed=raw+sum(c['sessionId'] in notes and bool(c['issues']) for c in first)
 rows.append(f'<tr><td>Additional {n-3} (round {n})</td><td>{raw}/50</td><td>{reviewed}/50</td><td>50/50 reviewed</td></tr>')
 fixture=root/f'tests/fixtures/chat-bounded-round{n}.json'
 manifest.append({'round':n,'raw_first_pass':raw,'reviewed_first_pass':reviewed,'visitor_turns':sum(len(c['transcript']) for c in first),'fixture_sha256':hashlib.sha256(fixture.read_bytes()).hexdigest(),'first_pass_sha256':hashlib.sha256((folder/'first-pass.json').read_bytes()).hexdigest()})
 for title,cases in [('Original first pass',first),('Final repaired replay',replay)]:
  items=[]
  for c in cases:
   issue=', '.join(c['issues']) or 'No automated check failures';note=notes.get(c['sessionId'],'')
   turns=''.join('<div class="visitor"><b>Visitor</b><p>'+html.escape(t['user'])+'</p></div><div class="sam"><b>Sam</b><p>'+html.escape(t['bot'])+'</p></div>' for t in c['transcript'])
   items.append('<details><summary>'+html.escape(c['sessionId']+' · '+c['label']+' — '+issue)+'</summary>'+('<p class="note">'+html.escape(note)+'</p>' if note else '')+turns+'</details>')
  sections.append(f'<h2>Round {n}: {title}</h2>'+''.join(items))
manifest.append({'final_sources':{p:hashlib.sha256((root/p).read_bytes()).hexdigest() for p in ['assets/js/raleigh-chat.js','assets/js/raleigh-chat-engine.js','tests/helpers/chat-isolated.cjs','tests/chat-fresh-batch2.cjs']}})
page='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Additional chatbot testing — full transcripts</title><style>body{font:17px/1.55 system-ui;max-width:1100px;margin:32px auto;padding:0 20px;color:#173a30;background:#fafbf9}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;background:white}th,td{padding:12px;border:1px solid #ccc;text-align:left}details{margin:12px 0;padding:14px;background:white;border:1px solid #ccd6d1;border-radius:8px}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}.visitor,.sam{padding:10px 18px;margin:10px 0;border-radius:8px}.visitor{background:#edf0f3;margin-left:30px}.sam{background:#fff5cc;margin-right:30px}p{margin:7px 0;white-space:pre-wrap}.note{border-left:5px solid #d6ae31;padding:15px;background:#fff8dc}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}</style><h1>Additional chatbot testing: three harder batches</h1><p class="note">Stopped at the agreed additional three-round limit. No fresh batch was completely clean. All repaired cases now pass their reviewed regression expectations. That is evidence of improvement, not proof that future conversations will have zero errors.</p><table><tr><th>Batch</th><th>Original automated passes</th><th>Reviewed first-pass passes</th><th>Final replay</th></tr>'''+''.join(rows)+'''</table><h2>Testing method and corrections</h2><p>Each batch's 50 scenario specifications was frozen and committed before execution. These are 150 automated conversations through the real local conversation functions, with adaptive scripted visitors and mocked service calls—not 150 manual browser sessions. They include qualification interruptions, corrections, mixed rental/investment intentions, colloquial slot selections, host requests, contact validation and cancellation. Shared answer templates remain in use; this is repeatable coverage, not an independent statistical sample of visitors.</p><p>Original results remain unchanged. Reviewed scores account for four test defects, documented at their exact transcripts below. The first batch's original mock returned unfiltered calendar slots; it now follows the service filtering contract. The final batch's scripted visitor asked for a nonexistent second alternative; it now accepts a sole offered slot. Two additional checks had incorrect expectations about referral booking and cancellation wording. Permanent assertions verify the correct behavior rather than suppressing those checks.</p><h2>What changed</h2><p>Meeting-format negation now respects phone instead of video. Phone-number questions retain an already selected host. Explicit host recommendations, changed area preferences, unknown budgets, numeric budgets, remote-work corrections, ownership locations and state suffixes are handled. Rental conversations ask whether an out-of-state owner is selling or keeping their home. Long rental plans with no purchase intent no longer switch into buying, and investing requests stay on the investor route. Scheduling recognizes abbreviated days and ordinal numbers, gives explicit dayparts priority over the word one, and distinguishes a rejected day from an accepted alternative.</p><h2>Release limits</h2><p>All 300 frozen journeys from the six rounds are retained in regression coverage. Existing chatbot test suites are also run. The availability, booking, email, lead and upload boundaries are mocked or blocked; no real appointment or client email was created by these conversations. The booking mock always displays Benjamin, so named-host assertions inspect the actual preferredHost request. These runs do not verify real round robin, invitations, pre-call email delivery, live service permissions, pacing or visual scrolling.</p><p>Changes remain local on Test. The production chatbot has not been published to Main, and live chatbot booking authority remains paused. The short-referral service deployment and a controlled real invitation/pre-call-email check remain release prerequisites. Because no fresh round was clean, these results alone do not establish Main readiness.</p><p><a href="../chat-bounded-review/report-and-transcripts.html">Previous three-round report</a></p>'''+''.join(sections)+'<h2>Evidence hashes</h2><pre>'+html.escape(json.dumps(manifest,indent=2))+'</pre></html>'
(out/'report-and-transcripts.html').write_text(page,encoding='utf-8');(out/'manifest.json').write_text(json.dumps(manifest,indent=2),encoding='utf-8');print(out/'report-and-transcripts.html')
